{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Pack : Card of Named is an expansion featuring six skills that embody the power of those who bear a name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With six distinctive skills and brand-new costumes, this pack carves new stories into your card battles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>MONSTER CARDS</i>, cards can be exchanged as files, so even players who do not own this DLC can still play with cards that use these skills. <br><u>What this DLC provides is the right to generate cards with these skills yourself.</u></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>During Early Access, even if you don\u2019t own this DLC, you can still generate cards with the included skills.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Included Skills</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cheer [Discard]</strong>: Gain advantage for this turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revenger</strong>\u00a0<strong>[Standard]</strong>: Gains advantage if your graveyard is large.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sky High [Standard]</strong>: Returns to the deck if conditions are met.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bolt from the Blue [GameChanger]</strong>: Reverses all matchups during battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trick or Treat [Standard]</strong>: Forces your opponent to choose \u201cTrick or Treat.\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ying Yang [Standard]</strong>: In the case of a tie, this card claims victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018672/extras/5764443dd180ecc641ba62e722982503.avif?t=1757078810\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Costumes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total costume parts included: <strong>28</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018672/extras/b6243da6bd537ca63f39f849fd73ae7b.avif?t=1757078810\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2018672?t=1757078810","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2018672?t=1757078810","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018672/41a8f65c12bf493cde3fc757f5c5336623cf65c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757078810","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018672/41a8f65c12bf493cde3fc757f5c5336623cf65c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757078810","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Pack : Card of Named is an expansion featuring six skills that embody the power of those who bear a name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With six distinctive skills and brand-new costumes, this pack carves new stories into your card battles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>MONSTER CARDS</i>, cards can be exchanged as files, so even players who do not own this DLC can still play with cards that use these skills. <br><u>What this DLC provides is the right to generate cards with these skills yourself.</u></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>During Early Access, even if you don\u2019t own this DLC, you can still generate cards with the included skills.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 cl